"col-md-4"><small>1120. </small><a href="?q=ZeelandNet BV" rel="nofollow">ZeelandNet BV (1)</a></div><div class="col-md-4"><small>1121. </small><a href="?q=Telecommunication Infrastructure Company" rel="nofollow">Telecommunication Infrast... (1)</a></div><div class="col-md-4"><small>1122. </small><a href="?q=Foilhat LLC" rel="nofollow">Foilhat LLC (1)</a></div><div class="col-md-4"><small>1123. </small><a href="?q=GLOBALTELEHOST Corp." rel="nofollow">GLOBALTELEHOST Corp. (1)</a></div><div class="col-md-4"><small>1124. </small><a href="?q=Beanfield Technologies Inc." rel="nofollow">Beanfield Technologies Inc. (1)</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><a name="join-the-network"></a><hr><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12"><h3><a href="#join-the-network">Join the Network</a></h3><p>Be part of the Bitcoin network by running a Bitcoin full node, e.g. <a href="https://bitcoin.org/en/download" target="_blank">Bitcoin Core</a>.</p>
<p>
<form method="post" action="/api/v1/checknode/" class="form-inline" id="check-node"><input type='hidden' name='csrfmiddlewaretoken' value='VeJOqjkIcW8gPO1RyxLXhRGwwaKsdkAwMgPOYeiROid1Z6aKncKx5oRkQTQyVv3V' />
<div class="form-group"><input type="text" class="form-control input-sm" size="30" id="address" name="address" placeholder="IPv4/IPv6/.onion" value="207.241.227.104"></div>
<div class="form-group"><input type="text" class="form-control input-sm" size="8" id="port" name="port" placeholder="Port" value="8333"></div>
<button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">CHECK NODE</button>
</form>
</p>
<p>Use this tool to check if your Bitcoin client is currently accepting incoming connections from other nodes. Port must be between 1024 and 65535.</p><div id="check-node-status" class="alert text-center"></div><div class="installer hidden-xs"><p>Start a Bitcoin full node on your Linux, Mac, BSD or Windows system to help validate and relay transactions across the Bitcoin network by running this command:</p><code>curl <a href="https://bitnodes.earn.com/install-full-node.sh" target="_blank">https://bitnodes.earn.com/install-full-node.sh</a> | sh</code></div></div></div><hr><footer><div class="row"><div class="col-md-9"><p><i class="fa fa-copyright"></i> 2019 <a href="mailto:ayeowch@gmail.com">Addy Yeow</a> (<a href="/static/txt/ayeowch.asc">PGP</a>) <a href="//blockchain.info/address/3JqGyB5AWySQNU7ESHMezadYsR5B8zjSQH" target="_blank">3JqGyB5AWySQNU7ESHMezadYsR5B8zjSQH</a></p><h3>About Bitnodes</h3><p>Bitnodes is currently being developed to estimate the size of the Bitcoin network by finding all the reachable nodes in the network. The current methodology involves sending <a href="//en.bitcoin.it/wiki/Protocol_specification#getaddr" target="_blank">getaddr</a> messages recursively to find all the reachable nodes in the network, starting from a set of seed nodes. Bitnodes uses Bitcoin protocol version 70001 (i.e. >= /Satoshi:0.8.x/), so nodes running an older protocol version will be skipped. The crawler implementation in Python is available from <a href="//github.com/ayeowch/bitnodes" target="_blank">GitHub (ayeowch/bitnodes)</a> and the crawler deployment is documented in <a href="//github.com/ayeowch/bitnodes/wiki/Provisioning-Bitcoin-Network-Crawler" target="_blank">Provisioning Bitcoin Network Crawler</a>.</p><p>The crawler maintained by Bitnodes connects from these IP addresses: <code>88.99.167.175</code>, <code>88.99.167.186</code>, <code>2a01:4f8:10a:37ee::2</code></p><p class="hidden-xs"><a href="/api/">Bitnodes API v1.0</a><span class="delimiter">&middot;</span><a href="/nodes/live-map/">Live Map</a><span class="delimiter">&middot;</span><a href="/nodes/network-map/">Network Map</a><span class="delimiter">&middot;</span><a href="/nodes/leaderboard/">Leaderboard</a><span class="delimiter">&middot;</span><a href="/dashboard/bitcoind/">Bitcoin Client Status</a></p><p class="visible-xs"><a href="/api/"><i class="fa fa-angle-right"></i> Bitnodes API v1.0</a></p><p class="visible-xs"><a href="/nodes/live-map/"><i class="fa fa-angle-right"></i> Live Map</a></p><p class="visible-xs"><a href="/nodes/network-map/"><i class="fa fa-angle-right"></i> Network Map</a></p><p class="visible-xs"><a href="/nodes/leaderboard/"><i class="fa fa-angle-right"></i> Leaderboard</a></p><p class="visible-xs"><a href="/dashboard/bitcoind/"><i class="fa fa-angle-right"></i> Bitcoin Client Status</a></p><p class="social-buttons"><a href="//twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Global Bitcoin nodes distribution&amp;url=https://bitnodes.earn.com" title="Twitter" target="_blank"><span class="fa-stack fa-lg"><i class="fa fa-circle fa-stack-2x"></i><i class="fa fa-twitter fa-stack-1x fa-inverse"></i></span></a><a href="//www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://bitnodes.earn.com" title="Facebook" target="_blank"><span class="fa-stack fa-lg"><i class="fa fa-circle fa-stack-2x"></i><i class="fa fa-facebook fa-stack-1x fa-inverse"></i></span></a><a href="//plus.google.com/share?url=https://bitnodes.earn.com" title="Google+" target="_blank"><span class="fa-stack fa-lg"><i class="fa fa-circle fa-stack-2x"></i><i class="fa fa-google fa-stack-1x fa-inverse"></i></span></a></p></div><div class="col-md-3 sponsors"><p>Supported by <a href="//earn.com/?utm_source=bitnodes.earn.com&utm_medium=footer" target="_blank">earn.com</a><br><a href="//earn.com/?utm_source=bitnodes.earn.com&utm_medium=footer" title="earn.com" target="_blank"><img src="/static/img/earn-logo.svg"></a></p></div></div></footer></div><!--[if lt IE 9]><script src="//html5shim.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/ht